  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Version 3.8.1 of the VRChat SDK will include the following features and changes:\n\n```\n\nYou can now specify up to 8 parameters on custom network events sent via SendCustomNetworkEvent. All types supported by Udon Sync work. In UdonSharp, you need to use the new [NetworkCallable] attribute. Your existing Udon scripts will continue to work without any changes.\n\n```",
